msgid "如何变换数据的模型（model）；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/dl/intro.md:9
msgid "目标函数（objective function），用来量化模型的有效性；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/tutorials/dl/intro.md:10
